      },
      "message": "feat(mcp): rename_operation and reorder_operation over the operation meta commands\n\nThe browser's Rename and within-setup drag and drop (PR #58), the Setups\nribbon cell and row (#322) and the per-setup browser grouping (#343)\nalready shipped #45's GUI scope; RenameOperation and ReorderOperation\nstill had no MCP tool. rename_operation changes only the display name\n(key and program position kept); reorder_operation places an operation\nbefore or after another of the same setup and answers with the setup's\nnew order. Both run the existing undoable commands through the session\nHistory, so each is one undo step and every refusal is a tool error.\nNo change to posting, simulation or rest order semantics, or to the\nproject file.\n\nPinned by tests/mcp_order.rs.\n\nFixes #45\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
